            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.23.4+2KI.23.5+2KI.23.6+2KI.23.7+2KI.23.8+2KI.23.9+2KI.23.10+2KI.23.11+2KI.23.12+2KI.23.13+2KI.23.14+2KI.23.15+2KI.23.16+2KI.23.17+2KI.23.18+2KI.23.19+2KI.23.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Isham 23:4-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka walenga cine konse konse uwa pa bufumu ninshi acilifye umwaice, elyo ayambile ukulafwaya Lesa wakwa wishi Davidi. Kabili mu mwaka walenga ikumi limo na ibili (12) ayamba ukufumya incende shakupepelamo isho bacindika mu Yuda na mu Yerusalemu, aputaula inceshi sha mulungu Ashera, afumyamo utulubi utwabaswa elyo ne fimpashanya ifyaengwa fyonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apeela icipope cakubongolola ifibumbili fya malambo ifya milungu ba Baali. Aputaula mu tupimfya tupimfya ifibumbili fya malambo ifyakufutumwinapo ububani ifyabelele pa mulu wafiko elyo abongolola ne nceshi sha mulungu Ashera, afumyamo utulubi utwabaswa ne fimpashanya ifyaengwa fyonse. Abuula fyonse afishonaula ayafiposa na pa nshinshi sha baletuula aya malambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aoca na mafupa ya bashimapepo pa fibumbili fya malambo yabo. Kanshi ifi efyo asangulwile Yuda na Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifi fine efintu acita na mu misumba ya bena Manase, abena Efulemu, abena Simeoni ukufika na ku Naftali, elyo na mu ncende sha mumbali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abongolola ifibumbili fya malambo no kuputaula inceshi sha mulungu Ashera no kushonaula utulubi tonse elyo aputaula tupimfya tupimfya ifibumbili fya malambo ifyakufutumwinapo ububani mu calo conse ica Israeli, elyo abwelela ku Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka walenga ikumi limo na cine konse konse (18) uwa pa bufumu bwakwa Yosaya, emo abombele imilimo ya kusangulula Iŋanda yakwa Yawe elyo ne calo, atuma Shafani mwana Asariya na Maaseya kateeka wa musumba, pamo na Yoahasi uwali kalemba, mukuya lungisha iŋanda yakwa Yawe, Lesa wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baisa kuli Hilikiya shimapepo mukalamba mukumuletela indalama ishatuulilwe mu ŋanda yakwa Lesa, isho abena Levi abalelinda pa mwinshi balonganike ukufuma ku bantu ba mu fyalo fya bena Manase, abena Efulemu na bonse abashelepo ku bena Israeli, na ku bena Yuda na bena Benjamini bonse, na bekashi ba mu Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Epakubuula ishi ndalama no kushipeela mu minwe ya bantu abo basalile ukwangalila imilimo ya mu ŋanda yakwa Yawe. Aba bantu ebalelipila ababomfi abalelungisha Iŋanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babuula impiya shimo bapeela bakabasa wa mbao elyo na bakakuula pakuti bashitemo amabwe ayabaswa elyo ne mbao shakulundinkanya ne shakupalikila amayanda ayo imfumu sha bena Yuda shalengele ukonaulwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba bantu babombele imilimo iyi ne mitima iyacishinka. Na baletungulula abanabo mukubomba iyi milimo bali ni Yahati na Obadiya abena Levi abafumine mu lupwa lwakwa Merari, kabili Sakaria na Meshulamu abafumine mu lupwa lwakwa Koati. Elyo abena Levi bonse abali abacenjela mukulisha ifilimba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ebaleangalila abakusenda ifipe no kutungulula ababomfi bonse mu milimo iyalekana lekana. Elyo na bamo abena Levi ebali bakalemba, bambi nabo bakafwa wa bakalemba elyo bambi abakulinda pa mpongolo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo bayambile ukufumya indalama isho batuulile mu ŋanda yakwa Yawe, elyo Hilikiya shimapepo asangile icitabo ca mafunde yakwa Yawe yalya Lesa apeele ukupitila mu mubomfi wakwe Mose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hilikiya epakweba Shafani kalemba ati, “Ninsanga icitabo ca mafunde mu ŋanda yakwa Yawe.” Elyo abuula icitabo acipeela kuli Shafani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Shafani abuula icitabo atwala ku mfumu no kuya sosa ati, “Bacilolo bobe balebomba ifintu fyonse ukulingana nefyo mwabebele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabafumya impiya ishali mu ŋanda yakwa Yawe no kushipeela kuli bakangalila na babomfi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Shafani kalemba aeba imfumu ati, “Shimapepo Hilikiya nampeela icitabo.” Elyo Shafani kalemba abelengela imfumu ifyalimo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo imfumu yaumfwile amashiwi ya mafunde, yabuula ifyakufwala fyaiko yalepaula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakonkomesha aya mashiwi kuli Hilikiya, Ahikamu mwana Shafani, Abdon mwana Mika, Shafani kalemba elyo na kuli Asaiya uwalesunga imfumu ayakuti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kabiyeni mwishina lyandi nelya bantu abashalapo mu Israeli na mu Yuda muye twipushishako pali aya mashiwi yalembwa muli ici citabo basangile. Pantu ubukali bwakwa Lesa ubuli nokutwishila bukalamba pa mulandu wakuti abafyashi besu balifililwe ukubaka ishiwi lyakwa Yawe. Kabili tabalecita fintu ukulingana ne fyalembwa muli ici citabo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
