            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Hulida abeba ati, “Ifi efyo Yawe, Lesa wa bena Israeli asosa ifyakuti, ‘Kebeni uyo muntu amutumine kuli ine ukuti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ifi efyo Yawe asosa ifyakutila, “Ndi nokuleta ifinkunka pali ino ncende na pa bantu bekalamo, ukulapisha konse ukwalembwa mu citabo ico baciya belengela imfumu ya bena Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa mulandu wakuti nabamfutatila, no kocela imilungu imbi ububani no kunkalifya umutima pa tulubi utwapangwa ne minwe yabo, eico ubukali bwandi buli nokuponena pali ino ncende kabili takwabe icilebulesha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kebeni imfumu ya bena Yuda iyacimutuma kukwipusha kuli Yawe ukuti, ifi efyo Yawe Lesa wa bena Israeli asosa pa mashiwi umfwile ayakuti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Pantu umutima obe naulanguluka elyo no kuicefya kuli Lesa ilyo wacumfwa ifyo acilanda palwa ino ncende na bantu bekalamo, kabili pa mulandu wakuti waciicefya kuli ine icakuti walepula ne fyakufwala fyobe no kwamba ukulila, eico ine ninkumfwa, efyasosa Yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba ndi nokukutwala ukwalala ifikolwe fyobe kabili uli nokushiikwa mu cibote. Amenso yobe tayali nokumonako ifinkunka fyonse ndi nokuleta pali ino ncende na pa bantu bonse abekala pano.”’ ” Kanshi nabo epakubwesesha amashiwi yonse ku mfumu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo imfumu yalonganika abakalamba bonse aba mu Yuda na mu Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imfumu yaingila mu ŋanda yakwa Yawe na bena Yuda abaume, abekashi ba mu Yerusalemu, bashimapepo elyo na bena Levi na bantu bonse ukufuma ku twaice ukufika ku bakulu. Yabelengela abantu pakuti bomfwe amashiwi yonse ayali mu citabo ca cipangano icasangilwe mu ŋanda yakwa Yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo imfumu yaiminina pa ncende yaiko apali uluceshi no kubukulusha icipangano pa cinso cakwa Yawe icakulaenda mu nshila shakwa Yawe, ukubaka amalango yakwe ne fipope fyakwe na mafunde yakwe no mutima waiko onse elyo no mweo waiko onse, ukubeela amashiwi ya cipangano ayalembwa muli ici citabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo abuula bonse abali mu Yerusalemu na bena Benjamini ukusuminisha icipangano. Abena Yerusalemu bacitile ici umwabela icipangano cakwa Lesa uwaba Lesa wa fikolwe fyabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
